  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "The Department of Justice Super Intelligence Task Force states that it will work to ensure U.S. leadership in SI is not compromised by misuse by foreign state and state-sponsored actors, transnational criminal organizations, and individual or corporate actors engaged in unlawful conduct. It also states that it will take affirmative measures, as appropriate, to promote American SI dominance. The task force says it will coordinate across the Department of Justice on a comprehensive approach that includes organizing criminal and civil law enforcement efforts, deconflicting investigations and matters, and recommending enforcement priorities to preserve public safety and prevent misuse of SI.",
